</Output>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L817" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">For this special case, we see that it is possible to isolate <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation> for each stencil. Let us do this using a loop.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L887" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">for j from 1 to 3 do:
    Stencils[j] := factor(isolate(Stencils[j], y[i+1])):
    print(Labels[j], Stencils[j]):
od:</Text-field>
</Input>
