</Output>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="">NiRRLFRyYXBlem9pZGFsNiIvJkkieUdGJDYjLCZJImlHRiQiIiJGK0YrLCQqKCZGJzYjRipGKywmKiZJImhHRiRGK0knbGFtYmRhR0YkRitGKyIiI0YrRissJkYxRishIiNGKyEiIkY3</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L821" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">Now, let us go back to the general case by undefining <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEiZkYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnRjIvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYn">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEiZkYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnRjIvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYn</Equation>.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L874" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">f := 'f';
Stencils := [ForwardEuler, BackwardEuler, Trapezoidal];</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="">LV9JLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nRzYkJSpwcm90ZWN0ZWRHSShfc3lzbGliRzYiSSxtcHJpbnRzbGFzaEdGKDYkNyM+SSJmR0YoRi03I0Yt</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="">LV9JLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nRzYkJSpwcm90ZWN0ZWRHSShfc3lzbGliRzYiSSxtcHJpbnRzbGFzaEdGKDYkNyM+SSlTdGVuY2lsc0dGKDclLy1JImZHRig2JCZJInhHRig2I0kiaUdGKCZJInlHRihGNSomLCZGNyEiIiZGODYjLCZGNiIiIkY/Rj9GP0Y/SSJoR0YoRjsvLUYxNiQmRjRGPUY8RjkvLCZGMCNGPyIiI0ZCRkdGOTcjRi4=</Equation></Text-field>
