<Group labelreference="L886" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">Note that these relations define our numeric stencils in the sense that they give exact relations between the approximations <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYmLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEieUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnLUYjNiYtRi82JlEiaUYnRjJGNUY4RjJGNUY4LyUvc3Vic2NyaXB0c2hpZnRHUSIwRictRi82I1EhRidGNS9GOVEnbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYmLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEieUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnLUYjNiYtRi82JlEiaUYnRjJGNUY4RjJGNUY4LyUvc3Vic2NyaXB0c2hpZnRHUSIwRictRi82I1EhRidGNS9GOVEnbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation> and <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>. However, if we replace the approximations with the exact values of <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYmLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEieUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnLUkobWZlbmNlZEdGJDYlLUYjNiUtRiw2JlEieEYnRi9GMkY1RjIvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYnRjJGQEYyRkA=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYmLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEieUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnLUkobWZlbmNlZEdGJDYlLUYjNiUtRiw2JlEieEYnRi9GMkY1RjIvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYnRjJGQEYyRkA=</Equation> they are supposed to represent, the above will represent only approximate equalities. That is, if we make the changes <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>, <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>, the left-hand sides of the above equations will only be approximately equal to zero. We call the magnitude of the discrepancy the &quot;one-step error&quot; in the stencil. Hence, the one-step errors in the various stencils will be</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L818" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">eq15 := [y[i] = y(x), y[i+1] = y(x+h), x[i] = x, x[i+1] = x+h];
for j from 1 to 3 do:
    Error[Labels[j]] := subs(eq15, lhs(Stencils[j])):
od;</Text-field>
</Input>
