</Output>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="">LV9JLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nRzYkJSpwcm90ZWN0ZWRHSShfc3lzbGliRzYiSSxtcHJpbnRzbGFzaEdGKDYkNyM+SSVlcTE3R0YoLy1JJWRpZmZHRiY2JC1JInlHRig2I0kieEdGKEY1LUkiZkdGKDYkRjVGMjcjRi4=</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="">LV9JLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nRzYkJSpwcm90ZWN0ZWRHSShfc3lzbGliRzYiSSxtcHJpbnRzbGFzaEdGKDYkNyM+SSVlcTE4R0YoLy0tLUkjQEBHRiU2JEkiREdGJSIiIzYjSSJ5R0YoNiNJInhHRigsJi0tJkY0NiMiIiI2I0kiZkdGKDYkRjktRjdGOEY/KiYtLSZGNDYjRjVGQEZCRj8tRkFGQkY/Rj83I0Yu</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L864" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">Similarly, the third derivatives can be removed by differentiating <Font style="Maple Input" executable="false">eq18</Font>.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L866" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">eq19 := subs(eq17, diff(eq18, x));</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display=""></Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L858" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">We now substitute our formulae for the derivatives of <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEieUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnRjIvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYn">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEieUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnRjIvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYn</Equation> into the error expressions.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L853" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">for j from 1 to 3 do:
    Error[Labels[j]] := subs(eq18, eq19, ode, Error[Labels[j]]);
od;</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display=""></Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display=""></Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display=""></Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
